// Companion to p24_import_vibex.vibe, and a probe in its own right
// (#2229): an executable root carrying an `export fn`, which ADR-0075
// says a .vibex does not have. Measured: it compiles, checks clean,
// and runs (`dep` below) -- the acceptance IS the finding, and the
// export stays unreachable because importing a .vibex is rejected
// (p24_import_vibex.vibe). When #2229 lands on the enforce side, this
// probe flips to a rejection naming the fix.
//! cli: check
export fn helper() -> Int { 7 }
fn main with Console {
  println("dep")
}
